From 94d787155469774035eb7edebd09f8c79f958ab5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bingwa Engineering <engineering@bingwa.mobile>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 15:15:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(ussd): optimize local processing, zero-sleep inline
 verification and root acquisition for v1.1.47

- Eliminate premature deferral in UssdNavigationValueWriter with bounded 3-pass non-blocking refresh verification
- Fast-path rootInActiveWindow acquisition in UssdNavigationService to bypass 53.84ms event.source Binder IPC stall
- Bound parent traversal to max 4 levels with active window fast exit
- Remove redundant duplicate snapshot captures in attemptPendingAdvance
- Bound snapshot tree traversal to 35 nodes and skip redundant Binder IPC text queries
- Fast-path field validation in UssdNavigationSendClick by comparing windowId directly
- Bump version to 1.1.47 (versionCode 82)
- Add regression tests in UssdWindowValidationTest
