+From 129c8abe91f66463218d81fc1362e15605166892 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Senior Android Engineer <engineer@bingwa.mobile>
+Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:06:37 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH] fix(ussd): harden window validation, accelerate field
+ discovery and verify signature lifecycle v1.1.22 (code 49)
+
+- Fix critical wrong window acceptance by filtering out SystemUI notifications and overlays
+- Require explicit dialog structure and affordances for com.android.systemui
+- Prevent signature learning from capturing unverified SystemUI notifications
+- Optimize root acquisition and eliminate slow traversal paths
+- Add pre-indexed COMMON_USSD_INPUT_VIEW_IDS fast-path and early exit to field discovery
+- Implement full 8-stage privacy-safe signature learning and navigation diagnostics
+- Add unit tests for window validation, non-dialog hints, and signature lifecycle
